    "action": {
      "type": "SET_CONTENT",
      "input": {
        "content": "Evolutio is named among the six Spanish-capital integrators, and the record says nothing else. That membership is a real and checkable fact \u2014 the Spanish market has few domestically owned integrators of scale, and being one of them means technology direction is set in-market rather than by a foreign parent.\n\nBeyond that, stack, size and open-source posture were all unresearched. The lead sits at priority 4 needing an OSS screen, and this note exists to record that the only thing currently qualifying it is the ownership category.\n\n---\n\n## Leads sharing this finding (1)\n\n**4 \u00b7 needs OSS screen**\n- Evolutio (ES)\n\nVerbatim research text this claim was extracted from:\n\n> Named among the six Spanish-capital integrators; otherwise unresolved.",
        "updatedAt": "2026-08-19T11:29:53.043292Z"
      },
      "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-19T11:29:53.043296Z"
    }
  },
